WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:04.866
DOCTOR STRANGE
Every night...

00:00:05.874 --> 00:00:07.723
...I dream the same dream.

00:00:10.954 --> 00:00:12.088
And then...

00:00:16.258 --> 00:00:17.959
[Gasping]

00:00:19.078 --> 00:00:21.411
...the nightmare begins.

00:00:25.544 --> 00:00:27.944
DOCTOR STRANGE
I did what I had to do...

00:00:30.941 --> 00:00:32.618
...to protect our world.

00:00:32.669 --> 00:00:35.380
WONG
You cannot control everything, Strange.

00:00:37.551 --> 00:00:40.319
You opened a doorway
between universes,

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:43.698
and we don't know who or
what will walk through it.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:47.600
DOCTOR STRANGE
Wanda.

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:50.074
What do you know about the Multiverse?

00:00:50.125 --> 00:00:51.550
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Vis had his theories.

00:00:52.305 --> 00:00:54.328
He believed it was dangerous.

00:00:57.789 --> 00:00:58.836
DOCTOR STRANGE
He was right.

00:00:59.551 --> 00:01:01.154
♪♪

00:01:05.042 --> 00:01:06.344
MORDO
I'm sorry, Stephen.

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:10.185
Your desecration of reality...

00:01:11.852 --> 00:01:13.233
...will not go unpunished.

00:01:18.455 --> 00:01:19.979
MYSTERY VOICE
We should tell him the truth.

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:22.030
♪♪

00:01:27.199 --> 00:01:29.794
[Screaming]

00:01:29.845 --> 00:01:31.845
♪♪

00:01:33.249 --> 00:01:35.563
SINISTER STRANGE
Things just got out of hand.

00:01:35.614 --> 00:01:37.614
♪♪

00:01:39.952 --> 00:01:41.301
SCARLET WITCH
You break the rules...

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:42.460
AMERICA CHAVEZ
Look out!

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:45.174
SCARLET WITCH
...and become the hero.

00:01:46.928 --> 00:01:48.721
I do it and I become the enemy.

00:01:48.772 --> 00:01:50.772
♪♪

00:01:54.269 --> 00:01:55.920
That doesn't seem fair.

00:01:55.971 --> 00:01:57.971
♪♪

00:02:02.525 --> 00:02:03.645
WONG
Strange!

00:02:06.724 --> 00:02:08.724
♪♪

